      "id": "claim_c1ca70dadb084d2dbbf2824ba2dcacf5",
      "statement": "On non-Windows platforms redacted execution runs the child on a PTY, putting stdin in raw mode, propagating SIGWINCH and passing combined PTY output through a streaming redacting reader; on Windows stdout and stderr are separate pipes each redacted with a shared redactor.",
