    {
      "id": "claim_ef448849dea245539e1ae6fa4ad28d5b",
      "statement": "For secrets of at least MinRedactableLen (4) bytes the redactor also matches reversed, base64 (std/URL, padded/raw), URL-escaped, JSON-escaped and hex forms, and for secrets of at least 8 bytes offset base64 middles so a secret embedded in encoded data such as Basic auth is caught.",
